WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.329
Nobody knows where each order is, or how long it's been there. People search on foot… and at rush hour, nobody scans.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.636
The order moves to the next stage… and logs itself.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.845
The floor plan shows what's in each zone. By zone, not to the inch.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.590
An order stuck in a stage? You get an alert.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.703
And you see how long each stage takes… and where work gets stuck.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.471
Horizon Trace. Where everything is and how long it's been there, with nobody scanning.
